    "summary": "In [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase), after a target is picked for the Stormsword siege cannon of this model, roll a D6 for that target and for every other unit up to 3\" from it. Every unit whose roll is 5+ is hit by a concussive wave.\n\nOnce this model's attacks against that target are done in the phase, each unit hit by a concussive wave takes D3 [mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds).",
